### Benchmark Summary

| Task | Type | Verification | Dependencies |
|------|------|-------------|--------------|
| find allium | Navigation/Observation | position_near_with_facing (4,0,4) d≤3 | Root task |
| find a llama | Navigation/Observation | position_near_with_facing (-5,0,-4) d≤6 | Root task |
| craft to yellow_wool | Crafting | inventory_has yellow_wool ≥1 | Depends on: find allium, find a llama |
| sell Potato | Trading | inventory_has emerald ≥1 | Depends on: find a llama |

**Difficulty Assessment**: Medium — requires visual recognition (flowers, llama), basic crafting knowledge (shapeless recipe), and villager trading GUI interaction. All within standard Minecraft mechanics.

